  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released a notification for the recruitment of <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"274\">Junior Engineer (Agriculture)</strong>&nbsp;on its official website. This recruitment has been announced for a total of <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"727\">134 posts</strong>. The <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\">online application process for UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Agriculture Recruitment 2026 </strong>will start from<strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\"> 17 September 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"878\">until 07 October 2026</strong>. Candidates are advised to check the complete details for <strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"974\">UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Agriculture Recruitment 2026</strong> given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Junior Engineer JE Agriculture Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 19 Exam 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>17 Sep